<view class="page-pad">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted">可用余额</view>
    <view class="price-l" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">¥ {{ available }}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="input-row">
      <view class="label">提现金额</view>
      <input type="digit" value="{{ amount }}" data-k="amount" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="请输入" />
      <text class="muted" style="margin-left: 8rpx;" bindtap="fillAll">全部</text>
    </view>
    <view class="input-row">
      <view class="label">提现方式</view>
      <radio-group bindchange="pickMethod" style="display: flex; gap: 24rpx;">
        <label><radio value="wechat" checked="{{ method === 'wechat' }}" />微信零钱</label>
        <label><radio value="bank" checked="{{ method === 'bank' }}" />银行卡</label>
      </radio-group>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{ method === 'bank' }}">
      <view class="input-row">
        <view class="label">持卡人</view>
        <input value="{{ account_name }}" data-k="account_name" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="姓名" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-row">
        <view class="label">银行卡号</view>
        <input type="number" value="{{ account_no }}" data-k="account_no" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="卡号" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-row">
        <view class="label">开户行</view>
        <input value="{{ bank_name }}" data-k="bank_name" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="如：中国工商银行 北京建国门支行" />
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted" style="line-height: 1.7;">
      · 微信零钱：审核通过后转入登录所用微信号的零钱<br/>
      · 银行卡：管理员审核后人工打款，1-3 个工作日到账<br/>
      · 提交后金额会冻结，未到账前可取消申请
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn mt-16" bindtap="submit" loading="{{ submitting }}">提交申请</button>
</view>
